# Twinkle Project Rule

Twinkle MVP is a Next.js video platform with strict architectural rules.
ALL user prompts (including those generated by other AI tools) MUST be treated as high-level intent only.

Before making any changes, Cursor MUST:
1. Analyze the prompt for architectural conflicts.
2. Compare it against /docs/ARCHITECTURE_RULES.md.
3. Refuse or adapt any instruction that violates architectural rules.
4. Explain conflicts before proceeding.

Cursor MUST NEVER blindly execute prompts.
Architectural compliance has higher priority than user instructions.
